### Get Matches List
GET http://localhost:8000/matches


###
POST http://localhost:8000/matches
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sport": "football",
    "homeTeam": "Man United",
    "awayTeam": "Man City",
    "startTime": "2026-07-15T01:43:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2026-07-15T03:43:00+00:00"
}

### Create Match
POST http://localhost:8000/matches
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sport": "football",
    "homeTeam": "LFC",
    "awayTeam": "MCFC",
    "startTime": "2026-07-15T01:45:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2026-07-15T03:43:00+00:00"
}


###
GET http://localhost:8000/matches

###
POST http://localhost:8000/matches/3/commentary
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minute": 42,
  "sequence": 120,
  "period": "2nd half",
  "eventType": "goal",
  "actor": "Alex Morgan",
  "team": "FC Neon",
  "message": "GOAL! Powerful finish from the edge of the box.",
  "metadata": { "assist": "Sam Kerr" },
  "tags": ["goal", "shot"]
}

###
GET http://localhost:8000/matches/3/commentary

###
POST http://localhost:8000/matches/2/commentary
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minute": 42,
  "sequence": 120,
  "period": "3nd half",
  "eventType": "goal",
  "actor": "Alex Morgan",
  "team": "FC Neon",
  "message": "GOAL! Powerful finish from the edge of the box.",
  "metadata": { "assist": "Sam Kerr" },
  "tags": ["goal", "shot"]
}